WEBVTT

00:04:28.454 --> 00:04:33.788
In 2020, our lives were dictated
by the headlines, the pandemic,

00:04:33.788 --> 00:04:38.996
racial injustice, a fraught election here
in the U.S. , intense natural disasters.

00:04:39.454 --> 00:04:43.954
And we saw the world differently
because we were alone

00:04:43.996 --> 00:04:47.746
or we couldn't get away from our
family because we got sick

00:04:48.038 --> 00:04:53.829
or we realized how lucky we were to stay
healthy because maybe we lost our jobs

00:04:54.329 --> 00:04:59.163
or we saw how fortunate we were to
continue making more money than most.